  "description": "For orphan-turned-prosecutor Hyeon Jeong-Ui, ambition is the only thing that matters. When a minor slip demotes him to a backwater outpost, his climb up the legal ladder seems finished, until a devil named Seo Cheong offers him a shortcut to the presidency. The price? Giving himself up to the insatiable demon every single night. The dark bargain works all too well, propelling Jeong-Ui to chief prosecutor in record time. Deciding he has milked the arrangement for all it is worth, Jeong-Ui sets his sights on becoming a chaebol son-in-law and tossing the demon aside. But Cheong has no intention of letting his plaything go, and breaking an infernal deal comes with a brutal reckoning.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
